Changes from the source:
  1. The main concepts are rewritten in Simplified Technical English for small
     teams and solo builders.
  2. Three new diagrams (assets/).
  3. A new agent skill (SKILL.md) that helps a small team make an incident plan.
     Its adaptations for small teams are marked as suggestions.
  4. The playbooks, case studies and architecture tables are not copied. The
     skill refers to them by section number.

